            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo DBS-386 Mortise 86 Cut Out Deadbolt Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis deadbolt conversion plate allows for switching from an 86 cut out (standard mortise lock) to a deadbolt strike hole. Used for residential or commercial doors to cover the area where a mortise lock box was removed. Packaged with 2 installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DBS-386_size.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo DBS-386 Deadbolt Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo DBS-386 Deadbolt Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 8\" (8.00)</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/4\" (1.250)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Primer</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each #12-24 x 1/2\" Flat Head Machine Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DBS-386.pdf?v=1704262440\"><b>Don-Jo DBS-386 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
